📑 COVID-19 Analytics Dashboard — Detailed Report

📖 Project Objective
The objective of this project was to analyze worldwide COVID-19 statistics using Power BI interactive dashboard reporting techniques. 
The dashboard was developed to monitor global pandemic-related insights including total cases, recoveries, deaths, testing statistics and population-based analysis across multiple countries.

📁 Dataset Information
- Dataset Type: Covid Analysis Dataset
- Source: Sample dataset provided during online analytics training sessions
- File Format: Excel / CSV
- Data Coverage:
- Total Cases
- Total Recoveries
- Total Deaths
- Active Cases
- Total Tests
- Population Statistics
- Country-wise COVID-19 information

