📊 Dashboard Structure

📌 Page 1 — Global Case Insights
This dashboard page focuses on worldwide COVID-19 spread and population analysis.

Features Included:
- Total Cases KPI
- Population Statistics
- Country-wise Comparison Charts
- Interactive Country Filtering
- Visual Representation of Highly Affected Regions

Analysis Purpose:
The page helps identify countries with high COVID-19 impact and provides a general overview of global case distribution and population-related trends.

📌 Page 2 — Recovery & Fatality Insights
This dashboard page focuses on recovery performance, death analysis and covid-related pandemic impact.

Features Included:
- Recovery Statistics
- Death Analysis
- Testing Insights
- Comparative Country Visualizations
- KPI Monitoring

Analysis Purpose:
The page helps understand global recovery conditions, fatality statistics and healthcare impact across multiple countries through interactive dashboard reporting.

